    <date year="1972" month="August" day="28"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">Idents are given here in two lists, a list in alpha order and a list
by Site address.</t>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-2">These lists include only those organizations with present or
scheduled direct connection to the Network.  Scheduled Sites are
indicated by "s".  Inactive addresses are shown as "i".</t>
    </abstract>
